# Barcode Scanning Anti-Patterns

## Camera-only scanning — fails in low light

```java
// WRONG — camera only, no fallback
BarcodeScanner camera = new CameraScanner();
```

**First: support keyboard wedge USB scanner. Camera is fallback.**

## No debounce on rapid scans

```java
// WRONG — same barcode processed 10 times in 1 second
scanner.onScan(code -> processScan(code));
```

**Fix: debounce — ignore scans within 300ms of previous.**

## Hardcoding ZXing dependency — vendor lock-in

```java
// WRONG — ZXing API used directly everywhere
Hints hints = new Hints();
```

**Fix: wrap scanner behind interface. Swap implementations easily.